# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# GitHub Pages site (site/) - everything served at
# https://mhemmett.github.io/axial-sws/ must be tracked, so re-include the whole
# site/ tree. Two of the blanket rules above would otherwise swallow parts of it:
#   * `results/` (near the top) has no leading slash, so it matches ANY directory
#     named `results` at any depth - including the site's own tab directory
#     site/assets/figures/results/. Git does not descend into an excluded
#     directory, so the directory itself has to be re-included before any file
#     inside it can be; `!site/**` matches the directory too, which is what makes
#     this work.
#   * `*.png` / `*.pdf` / `*.jpg` / `*.jpeg` / `*.gif` would hide any raster asset
#     dropped under site/. (The rendered figures are .webp plus one .svg, neither
#     of which is ignored today - negating the whole tree keeps that from ever
#     mattering.)
!site/
!site/**

# ...but still never track build/OS cruft that lands inside site/.
site/**/__pycache__/
site/**/.DS_Store

# DMODELS remake summary figures are tracked deliverables (the grids they come from stay
# in the ignored Axial_Deformation/); re-include them past the blanket *.png rule above.
!dmodels_axial/outputs/**/*.png
